{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-03-15 16:15:00', 'title': 'MOUVEX ANNOUNCES NORTH AMERICAN RELEASE OF H-FLO SERIES & G-FLO SERIES ECCENTRIC DISC PUMPS', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MOUVEX, A BRAND OF PSG, A DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) COMPANY, AND A WORLDWIDE LEADER IN SPECIALTY PUMPS, ANNOUNCED THE RELEASE OF ITS NEW H-FLO SERIES AND G-FLO SERIES ECCENTRIC DISC PUMPS FOR USE IN THE NORTH AMERICAN MARKET.'}